Subject: [PATCH v4 3/9] kexec_file: Factor out kexec_locate_mem_hole from
 kexec_add_buffer.
Date: Thu,  7 Jul 2016 13:23:29 -0300
In-Reply-To: <1467908615-18952-1-git-send-email-bauerman@linux.vnet.ibm.com>
